gt4-gs.exe (gt4recomp-gs)
==========================

This program is based on PCSX2 (https://pcsx2.net, https://github.com/PCSX2/pcsx2),
the PlayStation 2 emulator. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the PCSX2 project.

